[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-08), asked for
`acf-db-lib`. `acf-db-lib` depends on `acf-core` and on `lua`, which only
`lua5.4` and `lua5.5` provide, at no version. `acf-core` is a real name and
is decided first; its dependency installs `lua5.4`, which answers `lua`, and
`lua5.5`, of higher priority, is not installed. The rule of
`a-real-name-before-a-virtual-one-virtual-first`.

[repository]
